[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 351 - Emerge counts mana value, not power
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your second main phase. You control Wall of Stone, Goblin Guide and Grizzly Bears, and have Elder Deep-Fiend (emerge {5}{U}{U}) in hand with two blue and two colorless mana floating. End the turn with Elder Deep-Fiend on the battlefield.
Rule:authored-emerge-mana-value | Emerge's cost is reduced by the sacrificed creature's mana value (CR 702.119a): sacrifice Wall of Stone (mana value 3) and pay {2}{U}{U}; Goblin Guide (power 2, mana value 1) or Grizzly Bears (mana value 2) leave too much to pay
